&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;During the quarter ended 30th June, 2022, the Company has incorporated MITCON Biofuel and Green Chemistry Pvt Ltd., with paid up capital of INR 100,000/- as its wholly owned subsidiary company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;tr&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;td&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;During the quarter ended June30, 2022 Other Comprihensive Income (OCI) amounting to Rs.57.52 Lacs of Financial Year 2021-22 has been regrouped from Current Liabilites to Other Equity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;tr&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;td&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;During Financial Year 2021-22 a subsidiary namely MITCON Credentia Trusteeship Services Ltd, has approved a scheme of amalgamation with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;Credentia Trusteeship Services Pvt Ltd and an application has been filed before Honarable National Company Law Tribunal ( NCLT) on 23rd February 2022 and approval is awaited .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;tr&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;td&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Figures for the previous periods / year have been rearranged / regrouped, wherever considered necessary to correspond with the figures of the current period / year. All figures of financials have been rounded off to nearest lakhs rupees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock><in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfOtherExpenses contextRef="OneExpenses1D">Other Expenses</in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfOtherExpenses><in-bse-fin:OtherExpenses contextRef="OneExpenses1D" unitRef="INR" decimals="-4">52540000</in-bse-fin:OtherExpenses><in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment contextRef="OneReportable1D">CONSULTANCY &amp; TRAINING</in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment><in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue contextRef="OneReportable1D" unitRef="INR" decimals="-3">122373000</in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue><in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment contextRef="OneReportable2D">PROJECT SERVICE</in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment><in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue contextRef="OneReportable2D" unitRef="INR" decimals="-3">28544000</in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue><in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment contextRef="OneReportable3D">WIND/SOLAR POWER GENERATION</in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment><in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue contextRef="OneReportable3D" unitRef="INR" decimals="-3">36609000</in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue><in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue contextRef="OneD" unitRef="INR" decimals="-3">187526000</in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenue><in-bse-fin:InterSegmentRevenue contextRef="OneD" unitRef="INR" decimals="-5">0</in-bse-fin:InterSegmentRevenue><in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenueFromOperations contextRef="OneD" unitRef="INR" decimals="-3">187526000</in-bse-fin:SegmentRevenueFromOperations><in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment contextRef="OneReportableFinance1D">CONSULTANCY &amp; TRAINING</in-bse-fin:DescriptionOfReportableSegment><in-bse-fin:SegmentProfitLossBeforeTaxAndFinanceCosts 